      "coverage_note": "UVC Partners reports more than €700 million in assets under management and €400 million in newly raised capital for founders in 2026; the €400 million figure is not firm-wide AUM. Its stated €150 million growth allocation and portfolio-level investment limits are fund strategy terms, not commitments to a particular company. UVC’s Atira announcement describes a $17.5 million total company round led by Accel and says UVC increased its prior investment; UVC’s individual contribution was not disclosed. The portfolio and performance examples are selected disclosures, not a complete audited record.",
